  <text>
      <body>
         <div type="performance_playbill" rend="align(center)">
            <ab><hi rend="allcaps">Acted But Once.</hi><lb/>
               <placeName ref="namedentities.xml#lyceum"><hi rend="allcaps"><hi rend="italic">Theatre Royal, Lyceum.</hi></hi></placeName><lb/>
               This present <hi rend="allcaps">Thursday</hi>, <date when="1812-05-07"><hi rend="allcaps">May</hi> 7, 1812</date>,<lb/>
               Their Majesties Servants will perform a <hi rend="smallcaps">New Grand Opera Romance</hi> in Three Acts,<lb/>
               to be called The<lb/>
               <bibl><title ref="namedentities.xml#play_devils_bridge">Devil's Bridge.</title></bibl><lb/>
               With entirely New <hi rend="italic">Music, Scenery, Dresses, and Decoration.</hi><lb/>
               The <hi rend="allcaps">Music</hi> composed by <persName ref="namedentities.xml#jo_br">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Braham</hi></persName> and <persName ref="namedentities.xml#ch_ed_ho">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Horn</hi></persName>.<lb/>
               The <hi rend="allcaps">Overture</hi> by <persName ref="namedentities.xml#ch_ed_ho">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Horn</hi></persName>.<lb/>
               <castList>
                  <head><hi rend="italic">The Principal Characters by</hi></head><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#jo_br">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Braham</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#ja_ra">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Raymond</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#wi_lo">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Lovegrove</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#th_ma">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Marshall</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#vi_de">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">De Camp</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_waldegrave">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Waldegrave</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_ray">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Ray</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_miller">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Miller</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#wi_ox">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Oxberry</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>A Young Gentleman<hi rend="allcaps"></hi>,</actor><lb/>
                     <hi rend="italic">(Being His 2nd Appearance on any Stage.)</hi></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#miss_brereton">Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Brereton</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#ma_di">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Dickons</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#ma_bl">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Bland</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#miss_kelly">Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Kelly</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role><hi rend="italic">Chorus of Soldiers and Peasants.</hi></role><lb/>
                     Messrs. <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ch_da">Danby,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#jo_ca">Caulfield,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_cook">Cook,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_wilson">Wilson,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_me">Mead,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_jones">Jones,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ro_di">Dibble,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_whilmshurst">Whilmshurst.</actor><lb/>
                     <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_hope">Hope,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ch_ma">Mathews,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_go">Goodman,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#j_we">Wells,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_gussio">Gussio,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_rials">Rials,</actor> &amp;c. &amp;c.<lb/>
                     Messrs. <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ro_ch">Chatterley,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mo_me">Menage,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#jo_ca">Caulfield,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_mi">Minton,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_i_boyce">I. Boyce,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_jones">Jones,</actor><lb/>
                     <actor ref="namedentities.xml#j_we">Wells,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_barrat">Barrat,</actor> &amp;c. &amp;c.</castItem><lb/>
               </castList>
               The <hi rend="allcaps">Scenery</hi> designed and executed by <persName ref="namedentities.xml#th_gr">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Greenwood</hi></persName> and assistants.<lb/>
               The <hi rend="allcaps">Machinery</hi> by <persName ref="namedentities.xml#wi_un">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Underwood</hi></persName> and assistants.<lb/>
               The <hi rend="allcaps">Dresses</hi> by <persName ref="namedentities.xml#he_ba">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Banks</hi></persName>, <persName ref="namedentities.xml#ma_re">Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Rein</hi></persName>, and their assistants.<lb/>
               Books of the Songs may be had in the Theatre, and at <hi rend="allcaps">Barker's</hi> Dramatic Repsoitory,<lb/>
               Great Russell Street.<lb/>
               After which (<hi rend="italic">24th time</hi>) an entirely New Musical Farce, called<lb/>
               <bibl><title ref="namedentities.xml#play_turn_out"><hi rend="allcaps">Turn Out!</hi></title></bibl>
               The <hi rend="allcaps">Overture</hi> and <hi rend="allcaps">Music</hi> entirely New, composed by <persName ref="namedentities.xml#ma_pe_ki">M.P. <hi rend="allcaps">King</hi></persName>.<lb/>
               <castList>
                  <head><hi rend="italic">The Characters by</hi></head><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#wi_do">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Dowton</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#th_ph">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Philips</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#wi_lo">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Lovegrove</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_knight">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Knight</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#wi_ox">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Oxberry</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#ma_da">Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Duncan</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#ch_ti">Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Tidswell</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#an_sc">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Scott</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
               </castList>
               The Musical Farce of <hi rend="allcaps">Turn Out</hi>, is published by <persName ref="namedentities.xml#mr_sharpe">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Sharpe</hi></persName>, Piccadilly:<lb/>
               The <hi rend="allcaps">Music</hi> is also published by <persName ref="namedentities.xml#mr_w_dale">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">W. Dale</hi></persName>, in the Poultry,<lb/>
               <hi rend="italic">Books of the Songs may be had in the Theatre.</hi><lb/>
               <hi rend="italic">Vivant Rex et Regina!-No Money to be Returned.</hi><lb/>
               The Public are respectfully informed that the New Grand Operatic Romance<lb/>
               of the <hi rend="allcaps">Devil's Bridge</hi>, (performed last night for the first time) was received<lb/>
               with unbounded applause, and will be repeated every Evening till further notice,<lb/>
               <hi rend="italic">Saturday</hi> excepted.</ab>
         </div>
      </body>
  </text>
